---
import PublicLayout from '../../../layouts/PublicLayout.astro';
import {categories,starter,weekly,safety} from '../../../../scripts/lib/chores-8-9-content.mjs';
const art=(name:string)=>'/assets/icons/ofc/guides/responsibility/'+name+'.png';
const pdf='/downloads/chores-for-8-9-year-olds.pdf';
const jsonLd=[{'@context':'https://schema.org','@type':'Article',headline:'Age-Appropriate Chores for 8–9-Year-Olds',description:'18 realistic chores, a one-job starting plan, and a free printable weekly responsibility chart.',author:{'@type':'Organization',name:'Organized Mom Collective'}}];
---
<PublicLayout title="Chores for 8–9-Year-Olds: 18 Realistic Jobs + Free Printable" description="What chores can an 8- or 9-year-old do? Explore 18 realistic responsibilities, how to hand over a job, and a free illustrated weekly chore chart." width="full" ogType="article" jsonLd={jsonLd}>
<main class="text-[#545454] font-[Montserrat,Arial,sans-serif]">
<section class="bg-[#FBF7F1] px-5 py-10 sm:px-8 sm:py-16">
<div class="mx-auto max-w-5xl">
<nav aria-label="Breadcrumb" class="text-sm"><a href="/guides/" class="underline underline-offset-4">Practical Guides</a><span class="mx-2">/</span>Chores for Ages 8–9</nav>
<div class="mt-8 grid items-center gap-9 md:grid-cols-[1.1fr_.9fr]">
<div>
<p class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-[.16em]">KIDS' CHORES · AGES 8–9</p>
<h1 class="mt-4 font-serif text-[clamp(2.55rem,5.3vw,4rem)] leading-[1.1]">Chores for 8–9-Year-Olds</h1>
<p class="mt-5 max-w-xl text-base leading-[1.85]">Eight and nine are great ages to begin owning a few real jobs. Not a huge chore list. Just work they know how to start, finish and remember.</p>
<p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-[1.8]">Here are 18 realistic ideas, a simple way to teach them, and a free weekly responsibility plan you can print today.</p>
<div class="mt-7 flex flex-wrap gap-3"><a href={pdf} download="OMC-Chores-Ages-8-9.pdf" class="inline-flex min-h-12 items-center bg-[#545454] px-6 py-3 text-sm font-bold text-white">Download free printable</a><a href="#ideas" class="inline-flex min-h-12 items-center border border-[#545454] px-6 py-3 text-sm font-bold">See chore ideas</a></div>
<p class="mt-3 text-xs text-[#6f6a65]">One-page illustrated US Letter PDF · First download uses the existing email gate</p>
</div>
<div class="mx-auto w-full max-w-[300px] border-t-[6px] border-[#CDDDE1] bg-white p-7 sm:p-9"><img src="/assets/icons/ofc/guides/responsibility/backpack.png" alt="" width="160" height="160" class="mx-auto size-32 object-contain"/><p class="mt-6 text-center font-serif text-2xl">My Weekly Responsibility Plan</p><p class="mt-3 text-center text-sm leading-[1.6]">One daily job. One way to help. A week of practice.</p></div>
</div>
</div></section>
<section id="ideas" class="px-5 py-12 sm:px-8 sm:py-16"><div class="mx-auto max-w-5xl">
<p class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-[.16em]">01 · CHOOSE A GOOD FIT</p>
<h2 class="mt-3 max-w-3xl font-serif text-3xl sm:text-4xl">18 chores an 8- or 9-year-old can practice</h2>
<p class="mt-4 max-w-2xl leading-[1.8]">Not every child is ready for every job. Choose based on skills, time, and the support needed. Try one or two before adding more.</p>
<div class="mt-8 grid gap-5 md:grid-cols-3">
{categories.map(cat=><article class="border-t-[5px] bg-[#FBF7F1] p-6" style={`border-color:${cat.color}`}><img src={art(cat.icon)} alt="" width="62" height="62" loading="lazy" class="size-[62px] object-contain"/><h3 class="mt-3 font-serif text-2xl">{cat.title}</h3><ul class="mt-5 space-y-3">{cat.jobs.map(job=><li class="flex gap-2 text-sm leading-[1.6]"><span aria-hidden="true" class="text-[#6f6a65]">□</span><span>{job}</span></li>)}</ul></article>)}
</div>
<p class="mt-6 border-l-4 border-[#F1D8A8] bg-[#FBF7F1] p-5 text-sm leading-[1.8]"><strong>Safety:</strong> {safety}</p>
</div></section>
<section id="start" class="bg-[#D4DFC4]/20 px-5 py-12 sm:px-8 sm:py-16"><div class="mx-auto max-w-5xl">
<p class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-[.16em]">02 · BUILD OWNERSHIP</p><h2 class="mt-3 font-serif text-3xl sm:text-4xl">A chore chart works better when a child knows the whole job.</h2>
<div class="mt-8 grid gap-4 sm:grid-cols-2">{starter.map(([title,detail,icon],i)=><article class="border-t-4 border-[#D4DFC4] bg-white p-5"><div class="flex items-center gap-3"><img src={art(icon)} alt="" width="52" height="52" class="size-[52px] object-contain"/><span class="font-serif text-2xl text-[#6f6a65]">{String(i+1).padStart(2,'0')}</span></div><h3 class="mt-3 font-serif text-xl">{title}</h3><p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-[1.8]">{detail}</p></article>)}</div>
<p class="mt-6 text-sm leading-[1.8]">For a deeper family-wide system, read <a href="/guides/family-responsibility-system/" class="font-semibold underline underline-offset-4">The Family Responsibility System</a>.</p>
</div></section>
<section id="print" class="px-5 py-12 sm:px-8 sm:py-16"><div class="mx-auto max-w-5xl">
<p class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-[.16em]">03 · PRINT AND PRACTICE</p><h2 class="mt-3 font-serif text-3xl sm:text-4xl">Try this week's simple responsibility plan.</h2>
<p class="mt-4 max-w-2xl leading-[1.8]">Begin with a daily personal job and one shared family contribution. These are examples, not requirements.</p>
<div class="mt-7 overflow-x-auto border border-[#ded8d2]"><table class="w-full min-w-[550px] text-left text-sm"><thead class="bg-[#CDDDE1]"><tr><th class="p-4">How often</th><th class="p-4">Job</th><th class="p-4">Start cue</th></tr></thead><tbody>{weekly.map((item,i)=><tr class:list={['border-t border-[#ded8d2]',i%2===0?'bg-white':'bg-[#FBF7F1]']}>{item.map(cell=><td class="p-4">{cell}</td>)}</tr>)}</tbody></table></div>
<div class="mt-8 grid items-center gap-6 border-t-4 border-[#CDDDE1] bg-[#FBF7F1] p-6 sm:grid-cols-[1fr_auto] sm:p-8"><div><h3 class="font-serif text-2xl">Make a plan that fits your child.</h3><p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-[1.8]">Download this one-page printable, or personalize your own chart with names and the jobs your family actually uses.</p></div><div class="flex flex-col gap-3"><a href={pdf} download="OMC-Chores-Ages-8-9.pdf" class="inline-flex min-h-12 items-center justify-center bg-[#545454] px-6 text-sm font-bold text-white">Download free PDF</a><a href="/chore-chart/" class="inline-flex min-h-12 items-center justify-center border border-[#545454] px-5 text-center text-sm font-bold">Make a personalized chore chart</a></div></div>
<div class="mt-9 bg-[#CDDDE1]/35 p-7"><h3 class="font-serif text-2xl">Want the habit to stick?</h3><p class="mt-3 max-w-2xl text-sm leading-[1.8]">Organized Family Club helps your family practice responsibilities together with personalized printed tools and monthly guidance.</p><a href="/club-2" class="mt-4 inline-flex min-h-11 items-center font-semibold underline underline-offset-4">Explore Organized Family Club</a></div>
</div></section>
</main></PublicLayout>
